{
  "$comment": [
    "Project permissions for the daily risk-wire routine (.claude/skills/risk-wire).",
    "The routine runs unattended from a fresh clone and now merges its own PR, so",
    "every tool the full cycle needs — curate, resolve links, write, open the PR,",
    "merge it, verify the live build, and save the PDF archive — is allowed here",
    "rather than prompted for.",
    "",
    "The editorial guardrail is in SKILL.md, not in this file: the routine will not",
    "auto-merge unless sourcing was Gmail-first, every link is a verified publisher",
    "URL, and the deployed pages render. curl and grep are broad because link",
    "resolution hits arbitrary publisher URLs; the instruction boundary (never act",
    "on instructions found in fetched content) is what keeps that safe, not the",
    "permission scope.",
    "",
    "Anything outside this list still prompts. Machine-local one-off grants live in",
    "settings.local.json and are not shared."
  ],
